{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53096","headline":"忆北府弟妹（二首） 一 · 殷济","name":"忆北府弟妹（二首） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"骨肉东西各一方，弟兄南北断肝肠。\n离情只向天边碎，壮志还随行处伤。\n不料此心分两国，谁知翻属二君王。\n艰难少有安中土，经乱多从胡虏乡。\n独羡春秋连影雁，每思羽翼幷成行。\n题诗泣尽东流水，欲话无人问短长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷济","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53096.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53096","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}